{"type":"message","id":"627da2aa","parentId":"b613c995","timestamp":"2026-05-25T00:47:09.218Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The audit shows trailing stop is working - it updated BTC SL 11 times, and the SL is at 77867.3640. BTC entry was at 79820, current price is 77060.\n\nFor a SHORT position:\n- Entry: 79820\n- Current: 77060 \n- Profit: (79820-77060)/79820 = 2760/79820 = 3.46%\n- SL: 77867.3640\n\nSo the trailing stop IS active. But let me check - the tier 2 should lock at 2% profit. \n\nTier 2 locking at 2%: entry was 79820, 2% down = 79820 * 0.98 = 78223.6. But SL is at 77867.3640 which is even better (lower for short = tighter lock).\n\nWait, let me recalculate. For a SHORT, profit = (entry - current) / entry.\n- 2% profit means price dropped 2% from entry: 79820 * 0.98 = 78223.6\n- 3% profit means price dropped 3%: 79820 * 0.97 = 77425.4\n\nSL at 77867 is between tier 1 (78223.6) and tier 2 (77425.4)... actually it's closer to tier 2 territory.\n\nThe audit says the SL is being updated. So the trailing stop IS triggered and working. The SL at 77867 is already a decent lock.\n\nBut maybe the user is asking why it hasn't closed yet. Tier 3 at +4% would mean price needs to hit 79820 * 0.96 = 76627.2. Current price is 77060, not there yet.\n\nActually, looking at SOUL.md again:\n- Tier 1: +2% → lock 0.8%\n- Tier 2: +3% → lock 2%\n- Tier 3: +4% → close all\n\nSo the trailing stop IS working. The SL has been moved to 77867 which is below tier 2 lock level. The position is at +3.46% so it's between tier 2 and tier 3, with SL tracking.\n\nTier 3 close-all triggers at +4%, which would be at price 76627.2. Current is 77060, so about 0.54% away from tier 3.\n\nThe user might be confused - the trailing stop IS triggered and working, it's just not at tier 3 yet to close all. Let me explain this clearly.\n\nActually wait, I should also look at the actual current SL in the position to confirm. Let me check verify_trades too for cross-reference.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_CPIWAe1CY3FZEgU4tZYf6008","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 verify_trades.py 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":189,"output":1239,"cacheRead":24832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26260,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779670016777}}
