{"type":"message","id":"fb4102be","parentId":"fd2aa563","timestamp":"2026-05-25T00:47:25.014Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, let me look at the BTC SHORT position more carefully.\n\nFrom the position query:\n- BTC SHORT: entry ~$79,820, current ~$77,060, PnL +3.46%\n- SL was shown as $77,870\n\nFrom audit strategy:\n- BTC SL being updated: 77869.2830 → 77867.3640, 1 minute ago\n\nSo the trailing stop IS working. The SL has been moved down to ~$77,867 which is already locking in profit.\n\nNow, why hasn't it reached tier 3 (close all at +4%)?\n\nFor a SHORT position:\n- Entry: ~79,820\n- 4% profit = entry drops 4% = 79,820 * 0.96 = 76,627\n- Current price: 77,060\n- Distance to tier 3: 77,060 - 76,627 = 433 points = about 0.56% away\n\nSo the trailing stop IS triggered and working. The SL is at ~77,867, which is between tier 1 and tier 2 lock levels. The position just hasn't hit tier 3 (+4%) yet to close all. And the SL is trailing downwards as price continues to drop.\n\nLet me present this clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"移动止盈其实已经在执行了。三个工具交叉验证：\n\n- **audit_strategy**：BTC SL 被更新了 11 次，最新在 1 分钟前，从 77869 往下拖到 77867\n- **当前持仓**：BTC SHORT 入场 ~79820，现价 ~77060，浮盈 +3.46%\n- **verify_trades**：无异常\n\n你三档移动止盈的逻辑是：\n- 🥇 +2% → 锁定 0.8%（已触发）\n- 🥈 +3% → 锁定 2%（已触发，SL 正往下跟）\n- 🥉 +4% → 全部平仓\n\n目前 +3.46%，卡在第二和第三档之间。还差大约 0.54% 到第三档全平（需要价格跌到 ~76627）。SL 已经拖到 77867 了，利润是锁住的，不用担心回落。\n\n不是你担心的没触发，是还差一口气到第三档 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1280,"output":771,"cacheRead":25600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27651,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779670034523}}
