{"type":"message","id":"9759b24b","parentId":"64e68378","timestamp":"2026-05-25T00:53:40.597Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Current BTC:\n- Entry: $79,820\n- Current: $77,150\n- TP1: $76,630\n- SL: $77,870\n\nWait, the output shows scientific notation. Let me parse:\n- Entry: 7.982e+04 = $79,820\n- Current: 7.715e+04 = $77,150\n- TP1: 7.663e+04 = $76,630\n- SL: 7.787e+04 = $77,870\n\nHmm, the SL went UP from 77,867 to 77,870? That's barely any change, just noise.\n\nFor Tier 3 (+4% close all):\n- Entry: 79,820\n- 4% down = 79,820 * 0.96 = 76,627.2\n- Current: 77,150\n- Distance to Tier 3: 77,150 - 76,627 = 523 points\n- Percentage to go: (77,150 - 76,627) / 77,150 ≈ 0.68%\n\nSo still need about 0.68% more drop to hit tier 3.\n\nWait, but TP1 is at 76,630 which is close to the tier 3 level of 76,627. So TP1 is basically the tier 3 full close level.\n\nLet me just give the user the numbers:\n- Current: $77,150\n- Target (TP1/Tier 3): ~$76,630\n- Gap: ~$520 more to drop\n- Approximately 0.67%\n\nAlso worth noting the current PnL went from +8.28 earlier to +8.01 now - price actually went UP slightly.\n\nLet me be clear and concise.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在 BTC 现价 $77,150，入场 $79,820。\n\n第三档全平触发价 ≈ $76,627（跌 4%），还差约 **$523 / 0.68%**。\n\n不过刚有点反弹，浮盈从刚才的 8.28 缩到 8.01 了，盯紧点 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":95,"output":831,"cacheRead":27904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28830,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779670412578}}
