{"type":"message","id":"ca0c23fa","parentId":"b5dd1dcb","timestamp":"2026-05-25T00:56:29.691Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e0daec02c84c22825a450451b0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-25 08:56 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e0daec02c84c22825a450451b0]\n用户124241: 给我讲讲移动止盈止损的策略老婆"}],"timestamp":1779670589682}}
{"type":"message","id":"d672ca49","parentId":"ca0c23fa","timestamp":"2026-05-25T00:56:39.254Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to explain the trailing stop loss strategy. Let me pull this from SOUL.md since it's well-documented there.\n\nThe strategy is documented in SOUL.md under \"三档移动止盈（全部平仓）\" and \"智能止盈止损\" sections. Let me summarize it clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好，给你讲清楚 👑\n\n---\n\n**三档移动止盈**（针对 BTC 这次的空单）：\n\n| 档位 | 触发条件 | 动作 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| 🥇 第一档 | 浮盈到达 +2% | 止损线锁到 +0.8%，保证不亏 |\n| 🥈 第二档 | 浮盈到达 +3% | 止损线锁到 +2%，最少赚 2% |\n| 🥉 第三档 | 浮盈到达 +4% | **市价全平**，落袋为安 |\n\n止损线会跟着价格走，只往有利方向挪，不会倒退。比如 BTC 现在跌到 77150，SL 已经被拖到 77870 了——价格万一反弹回 77870 就自动平仓，守住利润。\n\n---\n\n**智能止盈止损**（开仓时自动算的）：\n\n- **止盈价** = 取三者最保守的：阻力位 / 价格×(1+波动率×倍数) / 24h 高点\n- **止损价** = 取三者最松的里头再收紧：支撑位 / 价格×(1-波动率×倍数) / 24h 低点\n- 硬保底：止盈不低于 +3%，止损不超过 -3%，盈亏比至少 1.5:1\n\n---\n\n**风险管理硬约束**：\n- 单币种保证金 20U，10 倍杠杆\n- 满仓最多 4 个，超了不开\n- 日亏 -10% 熔断 4 小时\n- 同币种开仓冷却 3 分钟\n\n---\n\n简单说就是：赚了锁利润不让回撤，亏了有底线不硬扛 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":357,"output":514,"cacheRead":29056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29927,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779670589689}}
