{"type":"message","id":"aff62140","parentId":"9e960c8f","timestamp":"2026-05-25T02:14:29.608Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if K-line data and 24h high/low prices can be fetched. Let me check - earlier I saw SSL errors in the log for K-line fetching. Let me check the current state more carefully.\n\nFrom the earlier log search, I saw:\n- 09:16 K-line retry for BTC with SSL error\n- Last night there were massive SSL errors for all coins\n\nBut the scores are still being generated (they show RSI values), so the K-line data must be working intermittently. The scores include RSI (which requires K-line data) and 24h change data. So it seems like the data IS flowing, just with occasional SSL hiccups.\n\nLet me check if there are recent successful K-line/24h data fetches in the log.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_un2DbkEcuf2zJlIAGElP7660","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace && grep -E \"高分扫描|K线.*成功|24h.*OK|ticker.*OK|ATR\" crypto_monitor.log | tail -5","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":379,"output":426,"cacheRead":48896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49701,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779675262466}}
