{"type":"message","id":"ab9c7344","parentId":"0cb781ee","timestamp":"2026-05-25T14:16:01.815Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, 4 positions all green:\n- SOL LONG: +1.50 (+0.75%)\n- DOT LONG: +0.00 (just opened)\n- ETH LONG: +1.27 (+0.63%)\n- BNB LONG: +3.53 (+1.78%)\n\nFloating P&L: +6.29 USDT\nRealized today: 0\n\nBTC is gone (closed earlier at 12:12 with +8.46). DOT was just opened as the audit showed.\n\nAll positions are LONG now, no more BTC short. The market seems to be going up across the board.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"4 张单全绿：\n\n| 币种 | 入场 | 现价 | 浮盈 |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| BNB LONG | $659.6 | $671.4 | 🟢 +3.53 (+1.78%) |\n| SOL LONG | $85.44 | $86.08 | 🟢 +1.50 (+0.75%) |\n| ETH LONG | $2,106 | $2,119 | 🟢 +1.27 (+0.63%) |\n| DOT LONG | $1.276 | $1.276 | 🟢 +0.00 (新开) |\n\n浮动 +6.29 USDT。BTC 中午已经平了，DOT 刚开进来，BNB 表现最好 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":406,"output":432,"cacheRead":73856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74694,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779718555061}}
