{"type":"message","id":"6f727454","parentId":"544f46b5","timestamp":"2026-05-25T15:46:32.649Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether the timeout on the hourly report push was caused by DeepSeek or network issues. Let me think about what was happening:\n\nThe push_hourly_report function calls IndicatorEngine.calc() for each symbol when indicators are empty. IndicatorEngine.calc() fetches K-line data from Binance (testnet.binancefuture.com) over the network through the Clash proxy. It doesn't call DeepSeek at all for the hourly report.\n\nThe timeout was caused by the IndicatorEngine fetching K-line data from Binance, which goes through the proxy and can be slow. It's a network/Binance latency issue, not DeepSeek.\n\nDeepSeek is only called when there are trading signals (AI analysis triggers), not during hourly reports.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"是网络的问题，不是 DeepSeek。小时播报不调 AI，慢在 IndicatorEngine 从 Binance 拉 K 线数据要走代理，偶尔会卡 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":307,"output":355,"cacheRead":82176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82838,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779723986498}}
